# Toolchain versions for reproducible builds.
# Used by asdf, mise, and the `make check-toolchain` target.
#
# These versions are what fixtures + generated verifiers were produced with.
# Regenerating fixtures with a different version produces different VK_HASH
# values and may cause `forge test` integration suites to fail.
#
# nargo: Aztec's Noir compiler. Install via:
#   curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noir-lang/noirup/main/install | bash
#   noirup -v 1.0.0-beta.20
nargo 1.0.0-beta.20

# bb: Aztec's Barretenberg backend (UltraHonk prover/verifier generator).
# Install via:
#   curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AztecProtocol/aztec-packages/master/barretenberg/bbup/install | bash
#   bbup -v 0.94.0  (matches nargo 1.0.0-beta.20)
bb 4.0.0-nightly.20260120

# foundry: stable
foundry stable
